    "body": "**Judgement call for the maintainer:** on the Mill-turn, X stays 0..650, measured from the spindle centreline. That band also checks live-tool milling, so a milled feature on the -X side of centre is still refused as out of stroke. How far a mill-turn's X may cross centre is left unchanged here; see `docs/decisions/493-lathe-z-stroke.md`. Gate green; no posted G-code changes.",
